ding at seq 557: [215.5234832763672, 118.21428680419922, 227.92138671875, 124.81377410888672]; requires reviewed raster region&quot;, &quot;unhandled image/shading at seq 558: [205.40335083007812, 54.30047607421875, 310.62451171875, 133.209228515625]; requires reviewed raster region&quot;, &quot;unhandled image/shading at seq 561: [266.35235595703125, 97.03321838378906, 284.3634033203125, 104.3739013671875]; requires reviewed raster region&quot;, &quot;unhandled image/shading at seq 562: [317.1895446777344, 70.12213897705078, 414.65667724609375, 143.21536254882812]; requires reviewed raster region&quot;, &quot;unhandled image/shading at seq 565: [333.0314025878906, 97.68888854980469, 353.00946044921875, 105.02386474609375]; requires reviewed raster region&quot;, &quot;unhandled image/shading at seq 611: [476.00787353515625, 62.197059631347656, 563.4403686523438, 135.06222534179688]; requires reviewed raster region&quot;], &quot;ignored_invisible_text_spans&quot;: 40, &quot;text_editability&quot;: &quot;Ordinary source labels, including cabinet type and lid type callouts, are typeable text. Three raster math labels are point-editable native contours, not live equations. Source plot and remaining photo-internal annotations remain raster.&quot;, &quot;dash_fidelity&quot;: &quot;Source custom dashed boundaries expanded into native solid segments with &lt;=0.4 scene-pixel chord sampling.&quot;, &quot;extraction_warnings_reviewed&quot;: [&quot;Ten source image instances reviewed. Three formula rasters traced to native glyph paths; seven images isolated with exact source transforms, masks and clips, then transparent extents trimmed. The segmentation chart is absent from get_text image blocks but recovered from source image_info and source SVG. Two plots retain source internal data pixels, without invented native plot data.&quot;]}">
